  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>Fuel your runs with the ASICS Gel-Cumulus 27. From a relaxing run to running past your personal goal, these sneakers featuring an engineered mesh upper keep you cool, comfy, and ready for another round. The FF BLAST PLUS cushioning and PureGEL technology are strategically positioned in the midsole to ensure softer landings and a more energized toe-off with every stride.</p> <p>Sustainability runs deep into these everyday trainers. At least 75% of the main upper is made from recycled content to reduce waste and carbon emissions. The sockliner is crafted with the solution dyeing process that reduces water usage by approximately 33% and carbon emissions by approximately 45% compared to conventional dyeing technology. Stay committed to the planet and your fitness journey with the ASICS Gel-Cumulus 27.</p> <p><strong>ASICS Gel-Cumulus 27 features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Knit heel pull tab allows easy on and off.</li> <li>Reflective details ensure low-light visibility.</li> <li>OrthoLite X-30 sockliner provides all-day comfort.</li> <li>FLUIDRIDE rubber outsole delivers superior traction and durability.</li> <li>Weight: 9.3 oz. </li> </ul></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS®</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS® Gel-Cumulus 27 - Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Taupe Grey/Black</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width 